    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "System Timetable, August-September, 1952\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nHawaii\nMAINLINER\nSTRATOCRUISER\nExcursion Fare ROUND-TRIP\n$240\nSEE DETAILS ON PAGE 2\nALL SCHEDULES QUOTED IN STANDARD TIME",
